# VK bytes get written here by `xtask regenerate-canonical`.
# Each circuit produces one file: `<circuit_label>.vk` containing
# the raw UltraHonkKeccak verification key bytes.
#
# Files in this directory are committed (binary) so consumers of
# `outbe-zk-canonical` can read the canonical VK at compile time via
# `include_bytes!("../res/vks/<name>.vk")`.
